<title>JAPAN: Aichi Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Aichi Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    37.95		vs	   41.27</p>
<p> Operating	    4.13		vs	    4.84</p>
<p> Current	    656    million	  vs	    2.49</p>
<p> Net		  595    million	  vs	  782    million</p>
<p> EPS		   54.42 yen	  vs	   71.51 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 25.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Aichi Bank Ltd is a regional bank based in the Tokai area.</p>
</text>
